%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Welcome to the Bushido ArmaTech headquarters. How can I help you?
#
o_text: I'm looking for a job.
o_goto: LookingForJob
#
o_text: You built things for Logan Faust once.
o_id: jana_faust
o_goto: Faust
#
o_text: Faust's cryo lab. Your design?
o_id: jana_faust_lab
o_cond: HasFlag('KnowsAbout(cryo_lab)')
o_goto: FaustLab
#
o_text: Nothing, thanks.
o_id: jana_leave
o_goto: End

name: LookingForJob
npc: Bushido-ArmaTech is always hiring. Security, logistics, field testing.
+ Though I have to be honest with you: we don't take walk-ins.
#
o_text: So how does one get in?
o_goto: HowToGetIn
#
o_text: Field testing? Testing what, exactly?
o_goto: FieldTesting
#
o_text: I'll come back another time.
o_goto: End

name: HowToGetIn
npc: Someone inside has to vouch for you. That's the whole process, really.
+ Make yourself useful to the right people and the paperwork writes itself.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: FieldTesting
npc: Weapons, mostly. I'm not cleared to say more than that.
+ The pay is good. The turnover is better.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: Faust
npc: I built things for the board. Faust was the one who read the specs before he signed them. Annoying, in a board member.
+ He walked out over Eschaton's partnership and took his signature with him. The specs stayed.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: faust_back
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: FaustLab
npc: (A flicker.) Four pods, a buried generator, an AI he insisted on naming himself. I drew it; he paid; the board never saw the invoice.
+ Pod three uses a fuse we stopped making. If it blows, it stays blown.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: faustlab_back
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: End
npc: Have a pleasant day.
effect: EndConversation
